    "## 10. Metrics, decision threshold and the models\n",
    "\n",
    "* **PR-AUC** is the main metric; **ROC-AUC** shows ranking quality independent of class balance; **Brier** measures probability honesty.\n",
    "* The **decision threshold** is picked on validation to match the operational goal in Config.\n",
    "* Models: majority-class baseline, Logistic Regression, Random Forest, XGBoost (with **early stopping**). Each is tuned on validation PR-AUC, including a **recency-weighting** choice for training tickets."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 33,
   "id": "b6a22e2a",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-28T13:35:51.582653Z",
